<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  NuGet package for the XrmToolBox Tool Library.

  Build:
    1. Build the solution in Release (MSBuild ReactiveFieldsUpdater.sln -p:Configuration=Release)
    2. dotnet pack nuget\Pack.csproj        (output in nupkg\)

  Keep <version> equal to AssemblyVersion in Properties\AssemblyInfo.cs, otherwise XrmToolBox
  always shows the tool as "update available".
-->
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>ReactiveFieldsUpdater</id>
    <version>1.2.0</version>
    <title>Reactive Fields Updater</title>
    <authors>Emilio Torella</authors>
    <owners>Emilio Torella</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>

    <projectUrl>https://github.com/ETReact/ReactiveFieldsUpdater</projectUrl>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/ETReact/ReactiveFieldsUpdater" />

    <!--
      Icon: ONLY iconUrl, no embedded <icon> (the XrmToolBox Tool Library rejects the nuget.org .../icon endpoint).
      pack shows warning NU5048 (iconUrl deprecated): expected.
    -->
    <iconUrl>https://i.postimg.cc/bwdrKGhq/Reactive-Fields-Updater-Icon.jpg</iconUrl>

    <readme>docs\README.md</readme>

    <summary>Update Power Apps fields in a smart and reactive way: change MaxLength, MinValue and MaxValue of many fields across many entities at once.</summary>
    <description>Update Power Apps fields in a smart and reactive way.

Reactive Fields Updater is an XrmToolBox tool to change field properties (MaxLength, MinValue, MaxValue) of Dataverse / Dynamics 365 entities in bulk:
- Filter and sort entities and fields
- Edit the new value next to the current one, with validation while typing
- Collect the changes as a list of operations, across many fields and entities
- Apply the selected operations in one go, optionally publishing the entities afterwards
Supports Text, Multiline Text, Whole Number, Decimal, Floating Point and Currency fields.</description>
    <releaseNotes>1.2.0
- New: filter boxes and sortable columns for Entities and Fields.
- New: Attributes grid with Current Value / New Value and input validation.
- New: support for Multiline Text, Decimal, Floating Point and Currency fields.
- New: "Publish after update" option, confirmation before updating and summary afterwards.
- New: Del / Ctrl+A in the Operations list; new operations are checked by default.
- New: entities loaded automatically; reset on connection change; confirmation when closing with pending operations.
- Improved: metadata cache and a single request per field, with progress messages.
- Fixed: error when clearing the Attributes grid; check state lost when adding operations; failed operations removed from the list; operations shared among tool instances; settings not saved.

1.1.4
- Introduced Responsive UI.</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright © 2024-2026 Emilio Torella</copyright>
    <language>en-US</language>
    <tags>XrmToolBox Plugins ReactiveFieldsUpdater Reactive Fields Updater PowerApps Power Apps Dataverse Dynamics365 CRM Metadata MaxLength Bulk</tags>

    <dependencies>
      <!-- XrmToolBox expects a dependency on "XrmToolBox" with the minimum version targeted -->
      <group targetFramework=".NETFramework4.6.2">
        <dependency id="XrmToolBox" version="1.2022.10.58" />
      </group>
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>

  <files>
    <!-- XrmToolBox loads tools from the Plugins subfolder; the tool is a single DLL with no extra dependencies -->
    <file src="ReactiveFieldsUpdater\bin\Release\ReactiveFieldsUpdater.dll" target="lib\net462\Plugins" />
    <file src="README.md" target="docs\" />
  </files>
</package>
